# Safety net only. Run artifacts now default to a MACHINE-LOCAL dir OUTSIDE the
# repo (%LOCALAPPDATA%\copilot-cleanroom\ or $XDG_STATE_HOME/copilot-cleanroom/),
# so nothing lands here by default. This still ignores a `results/` dir in case
# someone overrides -ResultsDir / $CR_RESULTS_DIR back into the repo tree.
results/
